# Bulk Migration Baseline (gated · DBS-FFW)

---

## When (ဘယ်အခါ)

- User asks: all pages at once, bulk scaffold, baseline wave, wire live 2025 web parts
- Editing `docs/migration/PARITY.md` for multi-route Status
- Adding multiple `src/webparts/*` in one scaffold pass

---

## Do (လုပ်ရ)

0. Rule `19-migration-skill-auto-invoke` — user prompt triggers; skill name prompt မှာ **မပြောရ** လည်း OK
1. Read `bulk-classic-to-spfx-baseline/SKILL.md`
2. Sync inventory: `docs/migration/PARITY.md` ↔ repo-root `progress.md`
3. **One web part per classic page** — hub `pageKey` router **မသုံး** (rule 17 wins)
4. Wave 1–3 may be one PR; Status = **wired / baseline** only
5. Run `gulp bundle` before marking baseline done
6. Wave 4 parity → switch to `classic-to-spfx-migration` + `classic-visual-parity` per slice

---

## Reject (မလုပ်ရ)

- parity PASS or Visual PASS claims during bulk baseline wave
- Hub router / single WP for all routes
- Heft / Fluent v9; new deps without user approval
- mk `dbs-mtj` paths, Burmese-only chat rules, or `reply #1 no code` workflow
- Porting backup/dead ASPX

---

## Status meanings (Status အဓိပ္ပာယ်)

| Status | Meaning |
|---|---|
| **inventory only** | Docs; no WP |
| **wired / baseline** | Loads; func stub OK; visual may FAIL |
| **parity PASS** | Func + visual checklist PASS (Wave 4 only) |

